 runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, November to December hit 60% of normal while March to April ran 160%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 36% and May to June at 174%.</p>"}
